<view class="page entry-page">
  <view class="entry-heading">
    <text class="eyebrow">快速记录</text>
    <text class="hero-title">今天发生了什么？</text>
    <text class="copy">饮食和运动可以写在一起。</text>
  </view>

  <view class="glass-card input-card">
    <textarea
      class="textarea"
      value="{{text}}"
      placeholder="例如：午餐吃了一碗米饭和鸡胸肉，晚上慢跑 30 分钟"
      maxlength="500"
      focus
      bindinput="onInput"
    />
    <view class="input-meta">
      <text>自然语言记录</text>
      <text>{{text.length}} / 500</text>
    </view>
  </view>

  <view wx:if="{{aiError}}" class="error-banner">
    <text class="error-title">智能识别失败</text>
    <text>{{aiError}}</text>
  </view>

  <view class="section-label">灵感</view>
  <view class="example-list">
    <view class="example-row"><text class="example-dot green-dot"></text><text>燕麦一碗、鸡蛋两个、黑咖啡一杯</text></view>
    <view class="example-row"><text class="example-dot blue-dot"></text><text>力量训练 45 分钟，主要练胸和背</text></view>
    <view class="example-row"><text class="example-dot orange-dot"></text><text>晚餐火锅，牛肉约 200g，青菜很多</text></view>
  </view>

  <button class="button" loading="{{loading}}" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="parseText">智能识别</button>
  <button class="button secondary" disabled="{{loading}}" bindtap="backToday">返回今日</button>
</view>
